        "contenuto_esteso": "Former Sen. Ben Sasse (R-Neb.) recently argued that \"Congress is not wrestling with big or important questions right now.\" It's a familiar critique. Americans across the spectrum have long been frustrated by performative politics crowding out substantive debate. But Sasse paired that observation with a deeper warning: \"What the digital revolution does is it accelerates..."
